821 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 708 0 R
/E (The EventForce Management System is designed to provide a centralized Salesforce- based solution for managing event planning operations, including client bookings, event scheduling, venue reservations, vendor coordination, cancellation approvals, reminders, and feedback collection. The system enables event teams to manage Events, Clients, Vendors, Venues, and Feedback using a structured Salesforce data model with appropriate relationships. Automated Flows handle event reminders and process updates, while an Approval Process manages event cancellation requests. Apex Classes and Triggers support advanced business logic such as venue availability updates and prevention of double bookings. A Lightning App, Reports, and Dashboards provide real-time visibility into event schedules, vendor activities, and operational performance. This initiative improves event management efficiency, booking coordination, data accuracy, communication, operational visibility, and customer experience. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
822 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 708 0 R
/E (The system makes use of custom objects, relationships, validation rules, Flows, Approval Processes, Apex Triggers and Classes, Reports, and Dashboards to automate important business activities. It also helps manage venue availability, avoids duplicate bookings, sends event reminders, processes cancellation approvals, and manages customer feedback. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
823 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 708 0 R
/E (The Event Force Management System is a Salesforce-based CRM application developed to simplify and organize event planning and management activities. It provides a centralized platform for handling clients, events, venues, vendors, feedback, and event cancellation details efficiently. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
