<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 799 0 R
/E (Data Migration, Testing & Security focuses on preparing and securing the system before deployment. This phase involved loading validated data into Salesforce, creating users, and implementing role-based access controls to ensure proper data visibility and protection. )
/Pg 101 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
2385 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 799 0 R
/E (During this phase, records for Events, Clients, Vendors, Venues, and Feedback were imported using the Data Import Wizard after pre-validation checks to avoid duplicates and maintain consistency. )
/Pg 101 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
2386 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 799 0 R
/E (User accounts were created for Event Admin, Event Coordinator, Vendor Manager, and Client, each assigned specific Profiles and Roles aligned with their access levels. )
/Pg 101 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
2387 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 799 0 R
/E (Security configurations included Profiles, Role Hierarchy, Permission Sets, and Sharing Rules to manage visibility and ensure compliance with business workflows. The Organization-Wide Defaults \(OWD\) were set to Private, allowing controlled record access through sharing rules like Event_Sharing_For_Vendors. )
/Pg 101 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
