/E (In Salesforce, OWD \(Organization-Wide Default\) is the baseline level of access to records that determines what all users can see and do with records in an organization. It is used to control visibility and access for all records in Salesforce, and you can customize it based on different objects \(such as Accounts, Contacts, Opportunities, etc.\). )
